title: "interfacespace: Registers of joint qualitative-quantitative claims"
abstract: >-
  R package implementing the interface space of a mixed methods evaluation:
  a register of findings, transformations, claims, relations among claims and
  decisions with reasons, with the registers of ten published evaluations of
  public services.
